BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:glue-smart-energy-ki-workshop-bern-2026@swissdataevents.ch
DTSTAMP:20261107T114104Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261112T170000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261112T200000
SUMMARY:Smart-Energy App mit KI entwickeln
LOCATION:Glue AG\, Schwarztorstrasse 31\, Bern
DESCRIPTION:A hands-on German-language evening building your own smart-mete
 r app with opencode.ai or Claude Code: pulling Swiss spot prices from the 
 BKW API\, logging feed-in readings hourly and writing monthly compensation
  out to CSV. Bring a laptop\, a gPlug and Docker.\n\nOrganiser: Glue AG\n\
 nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/glue-smart-en
 ergy-ki-workshop-bern-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/glue-smart-energy-ki-workshop-bern-20
 26/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
